    "text": "`kg:title`'s removal (see [History](../history/linking.md#id/BlockNode:00CDBZ7698003)) left several *other* concerns' own docs stale, deliberately not corrected as part of this one: `Aperas-crud-design.md` §9 still claims `kg:update` never touches a target's `type`/`title` (no longer true for a heading target), §11 still lists `kg:title` as implemented; `Aperas-interactive-summarization-design.md` still describes it as half of a still-bundled feature; `Aperas-apeironngn-design.md` and `Aperas-dev-status.md` both still reference it as live. None of these are `linking`'s own concern to fix.",
