    "title": "**Slice 1** (landed)",
    "text": "**Slice 1** (landed): the mechanism itself — lead-in-term title extraction, recognizing `aperas://`/`#fragment` link forms, and id-anchor emission (both headings and list items).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CDBZ77EG002",
