    "title": "00CGMT2Z98001",
    "text": "[x] **Lead-in-term title extraction** (`astParser.ts`) — landed as `findLeadInColonOffset`/`extractLeadInTitle`, revised after live corpus ingestion surfaced real corruption from the originally-planned raw-character scan; see [Lead-In Term Detection](../design/linking.md#id/BlockNode:00CDBYV4TG000) for the settled rule and [Finding the real lead-in colon](../discussion/linking.md#id/BlockNode:00CDBZ76TR000) for why.",
