    "text": "In `project.ts` (`serializeListItem`, project.ts:157-167, and the paragraph case): when a block's `text` doesn't already contain its own `id/<ID>` anchor, splice `<a name='id/<ID>' class='aperas-anchor aperas-id'></a> ` in right after the first `:`.",
