    "title": "**Incident: artifact rename has no working path yet**",
    "text": "**Incident: artifact rename has no working path yet**: Tried to exercise a rename (`cli.md` -> `cli-packaging.md`) to see whether the system's rename detection preserves block identity or silently treats it as delete+create. Neither scoped nor full ingestion actually renames safely today:",
