    "title": "Two ingest/parser gaps found and logged in Packaging — Issues",
    "text": "Two ingest/parser gaps found while drafting the Task Breakdown — a GFM task-list round-trip bug and `List` not being consumed by a preceding `Heading` — were parked here with no real home (wrongly logged in Packaging — Issues at first; reverted). Both have since moved to [TreeView — Issues](../issues/treeview.md#id/BlockNode:00CE1GW638002), filed alongside that concern's own gaps and slated to be fixed together.",
