    "text": "`design/`, `discussion/`, `issues/`, `history/`, `planning/` (each holding a `linking.md`) — pre-migration snapshots of the doc set already fully live at the top-level `linking.md` concern docs. Confirmed by diff: same content modulo slug-path vs. id-based anchors. Nothing to migrate here; archived for history only.",
