    ],
    "title": "`aperas show <ref>`",
    "text": "`aperas show <ref>`: Done. `kgShow.ts` resolves the normal deep-path way, then prints the node's exact stored fields via `dehydrate.ts`'s own exported `serializeDoc` — the identical per-kind shape walk that writes the on-disk mirror. `--text` prints only the raw `text` field, undecorated, for a byte-identical round-trip back into `kg:update` — see [Issues](../issues/treeview.md#id/BlockNode:00CE1GW638006).",
