    "text": "**Implemented and migrated**: all three cases live in `astParser.ts`/`project.ts`, corpus migration verified byte-identical (one approved, understood exception in `issues/packaging.md` — a pre-existing dead nested-list-wrapper chain whose old rendering quirk manufactured spurious blank lines). See [History](../history/list-consumption.md#id/BlockNode:00CE32GW3G002).",
