    "title": "00CF1WZ4JG00D",
    "text": "**`linking`** — 2 open, both filed: `extractAnchorNames` treats a backtick-quoted example anchor as a real claimed name, and `aperas update` never re-derives a non-heading block's title. See [Open Issues](../issues/linking.md#id/BlockNode:00CDBYV5A8002).",
