    "title": "00CF4D9XT0005",
    "text": "**[Deep write is inherently backward](#id/BlockNode:00CF46W4QG00R)** is realized by [the edit loop](#id/BlockNode:00CF46W4QG013)'s step 5, follow what the change made stale.",
