    "title": "## v1.1 additions — delta on the v1 snapshot",
    "text": "Threaded onto [the v1 snapshot](#id/BlockNode:00CF46W4Q8001) rather than snapshotted afresh: a snapshot is taken at a major version, and minor versions are recorded as deltas against it, so the base stays stable and what changed stays legible without duplicating the whole document each time. Each addition below is verbatim and individually addressable, which is what lets [the vertical thread](#id/BlockNode:00CF4D9XT0001) extend across the two.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CE8XWZJR001",
    "type": "heading",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CF4QNWZR002",
      "BlockNode:00CF4QNWZR003",
      "BlockNode:00CF4QNWZR004",
      "BlockNode:00CF4QNX00001",
      "BlockNode:00CF4QNX00002",
      "BlockNode:00CF4QNX00005",
      "BlockNode:00CF4QNX00007",
      "BlockNode:00CF5GK5BR001",
