    "title": "00CF4R3C78003",
    "text": "**[Dense linking is the precondition for both](#id/BlockNode:00CF46W4QG00S)** gains three realizers beyond the single narrow one it had: [edit loop step 5 rewritten](#id/BlockNode:00CF4QNWZR004), which restores the trigger v1 dropped from v0's item 18; [the dense-linking pass](#id/BlockNode:00CF4QNX00002) for the deliberate wide-radius case; and [Comparing distant docs](#id/BlockNode:00CF4QNX00007) for the commands. Presence was never the issue here — thinness was, and thinness is what changed.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CF4R3C78001",
    "type": "listItem",
