    "title": "## v1.2 additions — delta on the v1 snapshot",
    "text": "Threaded onto [the v1 snapshot](#id/BlockNode:00CF46W4Q8001) alongside [the v1.1 delta](#id/BlockNode:00CF4QNWZR001). Recorded because `scripts/skill_drift.py` reported all three the moment they were written, which is the first time the recording step was prompted by the tooling rather than by a reader noticing.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CE8XWZJR001",
    "type": "heading",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CF5ZE1S0002",
      "BlockNode:00CF5ZE1S0003",
