    ],
    "title": "**3. A props-only change reports as `0 changed`** ([issues/core.md](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00CFATMWY0001))",
    "text": "**3. A props-only change reports as `0 changed`** ([issues/core.md](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00CFATMWY0001)): `headingChanged` only compares heading `text`/`title`, never `props`, and never runs for non-heading matched pairs at all (their key *is* their text, so a changed leaf can't reach \"matched\"). Fix: generalize into a `pairChanged` check — `headingChanged`'s existing test, plus a props comparison (key/value map, order-independent) — applied at both call sites, for every matched pair regardless of type. Makes the summary line trustworthy for exactly the case (`checked`, `orderedList`/`startIndex`) this session already had to work around by verifying through traversal instead.",
