    "title": "**2026-09-15: Standing link integrity checking & repair (`aperas check-links`)**",
    "text": "**2026-09-15: Standing link integrity checking & repair (`aperas check-links`)**: Landed `checkLinkIntegrity` and `repairLinkIntegrity` in `@aperas/core` (`linkIntegrity.ts`) along with the CLI command `aperas check-links`, fulfilling the drift check specified in [issues/linking.md](../issues/linking.md#id/BlockNode:00CGN6GJVG000). Executing `aperas check-links --repair` on the active graph detected 40 historical link integrity discrepancies across 7 artifacts, re-resolving them all, and restored the graph to 0 discrepancies. Verified in `verify.ts` (step 19) via dropped-quad simulation. See [Discussion](../discussion/linking.md#id/BlockNode:00CH4J9398001).",
