    "title": "**Issues**",
    "text": "**Issues**: [Open Issues](../issues/linking.md#id/BlockNode:00CDBYV5A8002) — the open linking defects, among them the canonical-address authoring gap (the compat to canon to compat conversion, designed and not built), plus a Resolved section of everything else found and fixed.",
