        "@id": "BlockNode:00CJ6V6370003:props:StringProp:00CJ6V637G001",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "**Whether the tree renderer surfaces every position of a multi-position `Link`**",
    "text": "**Whether the tree renderer surfaces every position of a multi-position `Link`**: the graph carries one `position` prop per occurrence, and the endnote's `^ a b` back-references need one anchor per position. Whether `renderTreeWithView` emits such a link once or once per position is unchecked. A renderer question, not a model one, and it must be answered before the endnote can claim to be faithful.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CJ6V6370002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CJ6V6370004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**How a deep write is handed to the Agent**",
    "text": "**How a deep write is handed to the Agent**: composing an intent and handing it off — a copied prompt, an MCP endpoint, an embedded chat pane — is unexamined, and deliberately out of Phase 1. It is deferred rather than rejected, and nothing in Phase 1 should foreclose any of the three.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CJ6V6370002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
