    "title": "**Slice 1 — `buildRenderTree` in core**",
    "text": "**Slice 1 — `buildRenderTree` in core**: promote `discoverCone`'s plan to a returned render tree, redefine `renderTreeWithView` as `toText(buildRenderTree(...))`, and add a `format` discriminator to the `tree` service op.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CJ6V6CH0006",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CJ6V6CH8000",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CJ6V6CH8000:props:StringProp:00CNSWA2EG000",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "checked",
        "value": "true"
      }
    ],
    "title": "**Slice 2 — per-run auth token**",
    "text": "**Slice 2 — per-run auth token**: generate at service start, store in the run directory at mode 0600, expose for the dev server.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CJ6V6CH0006",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CJ6V6CH8001",
