        "value": "false"
      }
    ],
    "title": "**Slice 6 — links at two sites**",
    "text": "**Slice 6 — links at two sites**: link text as `cite-ref`, endnote list as `cite-note`, click-through both ways, one back-reference per position, hover popover that can promote a link into `unfolds`.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CJ6V6CH0006",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CJ6V6CH8005",
