    "title": "**Slices 5 to 7 are verified against `aperas tree --view`**",
    "text": "**Slices 5 to 7 are verified against `aperas tree --view`**: the same view rendered by the UI and by the CLI must agree on tier, canonical-position verdict and hidden counts for every node, since both now read the same render tree.",
