    ],
    "title": "**Slice 9 — the level fields on `TreeView`**",
    "text": "**Slice 9 — the level fields on `TreeView`**: add `unfoldsCollapsed` and `unfoldsNoPreview` as `reference`-kind subsets of `unfolds`, extend `removeDanglingUnfolds` and `pruneStaleUnfolds` to sweep both, and correct the former's doc comment where it claims `unfolds` is the only such field. Storage only — nothing reads the fields yet — so it lands and flushes safely on its own, and every existing view stays valid with both sets empty (the default level).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CJ6V6CH0006",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CMXF5K98001",
