    "title": "**Slice 14 — gestures**",
    "text": "**Slice 14 — gestures**: the click/shift/ctrl/alt/alt+shift matrix wired onto the row, the arrow and the stem alike. Fixes [ctrl-click on the arrow](../issues/webapp.md#id/BlockNode:00CMWN0XDG001) as a side effect rather than as a separate errand, since that bug is exactly the uniformity this slice has to establish; the `Gutter`'s `e.stopPropagation()` has to start letting a modified click through instead of swallowing it.",
