    "title": "**Slice 15 — width-derived depth**",
    "text": "**Slice 15 — width-derived depth**: compute `maxDepth` as `floor((width − buffer) / gutter)` in the webapp, thread it through `/api/tree`, and refetch debounced on resize. Independent of the rest and safe to land last; until it does, the cut-off state simply never occurs in the UI, exactly as today.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CJ6V6CH0006",
