    "text": "Design docs for the Aperas project, one per concern (webapp, treeview, linking, list-consumption,\npackaging, documentation, aperas-skill). Each holds the current, normative shape of that concern —\nArchitecture and Topology, not the reasoning that got there; see the matching `discussion/` doc for that.",
