    "title": "`aperas init` added",
    "text": "`aperas init` added: a fresh graph directory had no way to bootstrap `aperas.config.json`/`Apeiron/`/`artifacts/` — found live installing the published package into a brand-new project, whose service crashed on startup with a misleading generic timeout rather than a real \"this directory was never initialized\" error. Fixed with a new `aperas init` command — see [Configuration](../design/packaging.md#id/BlockNode:00CDHSJQE8001).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CDDVCKCG003",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
