    "title": "`aperas skill install` added",
    "text": "`aperas skill install` added: an agent working against an installed `aperas` binary had the CLI but none of the graph-first discipline this project's own `aperas`/`kg-doc-ingest` skills encode — those only ever lived in this repo's own `.claude/skills/`. Fixed by bundling both into the published package and adding `aperas skill install` to copy them into an agent's own skill directory — see [Distribution](../design/packaging.md#id/BlockNode:00CDW3R42G001).",
