            "key": "position",
            "value": "9"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "title": "### Batch 3 — multi-agent v3",
    "text": "Realizes [Multi-agent working](../design/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CR3X3N00001). The skills are drafted and reviewed before any tooling, since they are the contract the tooling has to serve.",
