  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CR3XQKNR004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "Install and record",
    "text": "Install and record: `aperas skill install` ships the base, role skills and agent definitions; the v3 snapshot is recorded in `discussion/aperas-skill.md`, and `scripts/skill_drift.py` is extended to cover more than one skill file.",
