    "title": "**A doubled `#id/` fragment in the grapher's Work was a render bug, not the grapher's**",
    "text": "**A doubled `#id/` fragment in the grapher's Work was a render bug, not the grapher's**: the stored link was correct; `tree --view`'s preview doubles an existing fragment ([the render bug](../discussion/treeview.md#id/BlockNode:00CR81SWZR001)). The orchestrator first attributed it to the grapher from the rendered preview, without checking the stored text with `aperas show`.",
