    "title": "**Design settled with the user (2026-09-27)**",
    "text": "**Design settled with the user (2026-09-27)**: the flag is `--detail short|long`, not `--format`, because `aperas tree` already has `--format <text|render-tree>` for output shape (code-only, absent from [Rendering](../design/treeview.md#id/BlockNode:00CE1GW4Y800G)). `short` = title, `long` = title + text; nothing else changes.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CR6BEFQG001",
