        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "**Two independent axes in `buildNodeItem`** (`packages/core/src/apeironNgn/node.ts`)",
    "text": "**Two independent axes in `buildNodeItem`** (`packages/core/src/apeironNgn/node.ts`): structural scope `childrenToShow`, driven by the view's cone/`unfolds`, and per-node detail `showAbstract`, driven by the tier logic. `--detail` touches only the detail axis. Bare `renderTreeLines` already recurses the full tree, title only.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CR7N8FM8001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CR7N8FM8003",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Behavior**",
    "text": "**Behavior**: without `--view` the default is `short` (unchanged), and `long` adds each node's text to the same full recursion. With `--view` the default is `long` (today's tiered render), and `short` forces title-only on every shown node, same scope.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CR7N8FM8001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CR7N8FM8004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Corrected on the way**",
    "text": "**Corrected on the way**: the orchestrator first claimed `long` without `--view` needs an `unfolds` set (wrong: `short` already shows the full tree), then proposed that `short` with `--view` ignore the tiers (wrong: only detail changes).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CR7N8FM8001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
