        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "**Repro**",
    "text": "**Repro**: a block whose stored text is `[design/treeview.md's Rendering section](../design/treeview.md#id/BlockNode:00CE1GW4Y800G)` renders under `tree --view` as `…#id/BlockNode:00CE1GW4Y800G#id/BlockNode:00CE1GW4Y800G`. The stored text and its `Link` are correct, and `aperas check-links` is right to stay clean.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CR81SWZR001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
