  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CR874TC8003",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "Status",
    "text": "Status: **v3.1** — the base every role loads: four levels, Philosophy through Mechanics, each item explaining a consequence of the one above it. What each role does with it lives in its role skill — `aperas-orchestrator`, `aperas-grapher`, `aperas-coder`. Only current, verified items appear here; superseded material, unverified hypotheses and version-by-version rationale live in `discussion/aperas-skill.md`'s snapshot and deltas. Concern docs: `AperasKG/artifacts/{design,issues,planning,history,discussion}/aperas-skill.md`.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CR874TC8002",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CR874TC8004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "### aperas — Discipline — The task loop",
    "text": "Every task runs the same sequence of turns. Each role skill details its own turns; the whole sequence lives here, so every role knows what comes before and after its part:",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CR874TC8001",
    "type": "heading",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CR874TC8005",
      "BlockNode:00CR874TC8006",
