    "title": "### aperas — Discipline — Stage each verified step, every role stages its own writes",
    "text": "Supersedes: [v3's per-role staging sentence](#id/BlockNode:00CR5GCSF8008)",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CR874TC8001",
    "type": "heading",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CR874TCG006"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CR874TCG006",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CR874TCG006",
    "text": "Every role stages what it writes, in the repo it wrote to: the orchestrator and the grapher stage `AperasKG/`, the coder stages the code repo. The checkpoint exists for the writer's own recovery, so it is never left to another role's next turn.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CR874TCG005",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
  },
