            "key": "position",
            "value": "12"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "title": "### aperas-coder — A survey turn changes no code — the first turn is always a survey",
    "text": "Supersedes: [v3's survey-turn paragraph](#id/BlockNode:00CR5GCSH000T)",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CR874TC8001",
    "type": "heading",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CR874TD8006"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CR874TD8006",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CR874TD8006",
    "text": "The first coder turn of a task is a survey (base: *The task loop*): read the code the Ask points at, map where the behavior lives, and report that map. The grapher files it before any change is made, which is what lets the change turn start from a recorded picture instead of the one in your context.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CR874TD8005",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
  },
  {
