    "title": "**Orchestrator verified the grapher's recording turn**",
    "text": "**Orchestrator verified the grapher's recording turn**: `skills/aperas/scripts/skill_drift.py` reports 0 added, 0 dropped and 12 superseded (all accounted for) against the [v3.1 delta](../discussion/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CR874TC8001). The code repo has no top-level `scripts/`, so the skill's `scripts/skill_drift.py` path is wrong as the grapher reported. The skill edit itself landed as commit `67c695e`, committed by the user.",
