    "title": "### aperas-grapher — Checking the skill against its own record — the drift-script path corrected",
    "text": "Supersedes: [v3's opening paragraph of Checking the skill against its own record](#id/BlockNode:00CR5GCSH0004), [v3's drift-script commands](#id/BlockNode:00CR5GCSH0005)",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CR874TC8001",
    "type": "heading",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CR8JDSQG002",
      "BlockNode:00CR8JDSQG003"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CR8JDSQG002",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CR8JDSQG002",
    "text": "`SKILL.md` is a *generative* projection of its concern — authored from design rather than serialized by a command — so unlike an `aperas project` artifact it can drift from its source with nothing detecting it. `skill_drift.py`, in the base `aperas` skill's `scripts/`, compares the file against the graph's record of it (the latest snapshot plus the deltas above it). From the repo root:",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CR8JDSQG001",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CR8JDSQG003",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CR8JDSQG003",
    "text": "```bash\nskills/aperas/scripts/skill_drift.py              # both directions\nskills/aperas/scripts/skill_drift.py --added      # written into the file, never recorded\nskills/aperas/scripts/skill_drift.py --dropped    # recorded, no longer in the file\n```",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CR8JDSQG001",
    "type": "code",
    "children": []
  },
  {
