    "title": "**Recorded and promoted**",
    "text": "**Recorded and promoted**: the two skill edits are recorded in the v3.1 delta as [aperas — Discipline — Threads, every turn has subturns](#id/BlockNode:00CR8JD5VG001) and [aperas-grapher — Checking the skill against its own record — the drift-script path corrected](#id/BlockNode:00CR8JDSQG001); the subturn rule is promoted to design's [Threads](../design/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CR3X3N08004). The history milestones are [v3](../history/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CR8MWVY8001) and [v3.1](../history/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CR8MWVYG000). The v2.3-onward sections now sit under this document's H1, ids unchanged.",
