    "title": "**Decided — history, round two** (2026-09-27)",
    "text": "**Decided — history, round two** (2026-09-27): the grapher adds the missing v2.1–v2.11 milestones to `history/aperas-skill.md`, matching the v1.1–v1.4 convention, and rewrites its Current Status paragraph, which still describes the v1 restructure, for v3.1. The user also had the [`check-links` prefix bug](../discussion/cli.md#id/BlockNode:00CR8RVCF8001) filed, not reserved as a test task.",
