    "title": "**v2.11 — the `kg:*`-to-`aperas` rename's one missed spot, closed**",
    "text": "**v2.11 — the `kg:*`-to-`aperas` rename's one missed spot, closed**: root `package.json`'s `kg:*` npm scripts were removed now that the `aperas` dispatcher covers every verb identically in dev and packaged; runtime `console.log`/`console.error` prefixes across every `kgX.ts` file, plus the flush/reload conflict-resolution hint, were rewritten from `[ApeironNgn kg:X]`/`npm run kg:X` to `[aperas X]`/`npm run aperas -- X` to match — the `--help` usage lines had already been rewritten in an earlier pass, but these runtime messages had been missed until now. Recorded as [the v2.11 delta](../discussion/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CQYGPR50001).",
