    "title": "**`aperas check-links` still prints the old `[ApeironNgn check-links]` prefix**",
    "text": "**`aperas check-links` still prints the old `[ApeironNgn check-links]` prefix**: `packages/cli/src/kgCheckLinks.ts` prints `[ApeironNgn check-links]` at all five sites (lines 44, 58, 61, 65, 79) — every other `kgX.ts` file's runtime `console.log`/`console.error` prefix was already rewritten from `[ApeironNgn kg:X]` to `[aperas X]`, matching [the `aperas` dispatcher covering every verb identically](../design/packaging.md#id/BlockNode:00CDGTZHSR005). This file's prefix had no `kg:` in it, which likely let it escape a pattern-based rename. Fix: reword the five sites to `[aperas check-links]`, matching the convention every other command's runtime prefix already follows. Found by the grapher, reproduced by the orchestrator, 2026-09-27.",
