    "title": "### aperas-grapher — Filing — after each coder turn, tool gaps get filed too",
    "text": "Supersedes: [v3's Filing section](#id/BlockNode:00CR5GCSGG00D)",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CR874TC8001",
