    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CR9D9NQG002",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CR9D9NQG002",
    "text": "Read the coder's latest Report and the Work under it in `.threads/coder.md`. Record what the coder found where it belongs: into the task's `discussion` freeflow first, then promoted into `issues`/`history`/`design` once it has earned a home (*Discussion is where meta-info is born*, below). Copy content up; never link into a thread. Where the coder reports code and design disagreeing, that discrepancy is itself the finding — record it, and fix whichever side is stale. File every tool gap in a Report, the coder's or your own, in the freeflow of the concern that owns the tool.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CR9D9NQG001",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
  },
