    "title": "### aperas — Discipline — Threads, distinct lead-in terms for multiple Tool gaps",
    "text": "Supersedes: [v3.1's single-example Report template](#id/BlockNode:00CR9D1WW0001)",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CR874TC8001",
