    "title": "**Recorded and promoted**",
    "text": "**Recorded and promoted**: [aperas — Discipline — Threads, distinct lead-in terms for multiple Tool gaps](../discussion/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CRBYWS98001) records this as a v3.1 delta entry, superseding [the single-example Report template](../discussion/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CR9D1WW0001); the rule is promoted to design's [Threads](../design/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CR3X3N08004). The `--text-only` message bug and the cap-removal clarification are left where they already are, per this task's Ask.",
