    "text": "**Skill v4 — comprehensive rewrite to clear form across all roles (2026-09-28)**: user requested a rewrite of the entire skill suite to eliminate Claude-style rambling prose in favor of crisp, operational form. Bumped to major version v4 due to comprehensive restructuring across all four skill files (`aperas`, `aperas-orchestrator`, `aperas-coder`, `aperas-grapher`), committed in code repo as `fd574be`.",
