    "title": "**Major version bump to v4**",
    "text": "**Major version bump to v4**: comprehensive rewrite across all four skills rather than incremental delta items. In `discussion/aperas-skill.md`, major versions are recorded as a verbatim snapshot (`## v4 SKILL.md (verbatim)`) rather than an unwieldy list of delta items.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS0YM5H8001",
