  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS0YM5H8003",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Preserving four-level architecture**",
    "text": "**Preserving four-level architecture**: kept Philosophy, Orientation, Discipline, Mechanics, but stripped rambling prose and restored the dense CLI cheatsheet, quick syntax table, and operational rules.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS0YM5H8001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS0YM5H8004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Operational gates upfront**",
    "text": "**Operational gates upfront**: base skill begins with the mandatory gate: NEVER START WITH file tools (`grep`, `view_file`, etc.) on `artifacts/**` before inspecting with `aperas` CLI. Orchestrator never investigates or modifies code at task start; code survey/changes are delegated to coder, with orchestrator touching code/diffs/tests strictly at Step 7 Verification.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS0YM5H8001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS0YM5H8005",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**In-flight triage protocol**",
    "text": "**In-flight triage protocol**: orchestrator checks `aperas profile list <p>` and inspects `<p>-coder-orchestrator` and `<p>-grapher-orchestrator` to resume in-flight work safely.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS0YM5H8001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
