    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593N8011",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "#### 7. Route Every Step, However Small",
    "text": "Never bypass the multi-agent loop for \"trivial\" fixes (e.g. a one-line code patch or a minor doc edit).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593N001Q",
    "type": "heading",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CS1593N8012",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593N8013"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593N8012",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593N8012:props:StringProp:00CS15984G002",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593N8012:props:StringProp:00CS15984G003",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00CS1593N8012",
    "text": "Doing it yourself skips the backlink checks, provenance recording, and thread checkpoints that maintain graph integrity.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593N8011",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593N8013",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593N8013",
    "text": "Route graph fixes to the Grapher and code changes to the Coder.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593N8011",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593N8014",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "### aperas-coder/SKILL.md",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593MG001",
    "type": "heading",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CS1593N8015",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593N8016",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593N8017",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593N8018",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593N8019",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593N801A",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593N801B",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NG005",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00C",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00P",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00T"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593N8015",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593N8015",
    "text": "```\n---\nname: aperas-coder\ndescription: >-\n  The coder role in Aperas multi-agent work: surveys and changes source code, reads the graph\n  for context, writes only to its own thread. Preloaded by the aperas-coder subagent; load it\n  only when acting as coder. Requires the base `aperas` skill.\n---\n```",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593N8014",
    "type": "code",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593N8016",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "Status",
    "text": "Status: **v4** — Coder role skill.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593N8014",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593N8017",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593N8017",
    "text": "You are the **Coder**. You inspect, map, and modify source code in this codebase.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593N8014",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593N8018",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593N8018",
    "text": "The base `aperas` skill applies in full. You read the graph for context, change source code, and write to exactly one place in the graph: your own nodes in `.threads/coder.md`.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593N8014",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593N8019",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593N8019",
    "text": "> **Aperas-repo insiders**: Run CLI commands from `Aperas/monorepo/` as `npm run aperas -- <verb> ...`. In normal projects using the published package, run bare `aperas <verb> ...`.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593N8014",
    "type": "blockquote",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593N801A",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593N801A",
    "text": "---",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593N8014",
    "type": "thematicBreak",
    "children": []
  },
  {
