  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG000",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593NG000",
    "text": "Respond in chat with 1–2 lines naming the view and key status.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593N801S",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Stage Verified Code**",
    "text": "**Stage Verified Code**:",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593N801B",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NG002"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG002",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG002:props:StringProp:00CS15985R002",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG002:props:StringProp:00CS159860000",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "Stage tested code changes immediately",
    "text": "Stage tested code changes immediately: `git add <files>` (staging only, never `git commit`).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG003",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593NG003",
    "text": "> **Rule**: A turn is not complete until Step 4 (Report and view zoom) is done.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593N801B",
    "type": "blockquote",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593NG004",
    "text": "---",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593N801B",
    "type": "thematicBreak",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG005",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "#### 2. A Survey Turn Changes No Code",
    "text": "The first turn of any task is a **Coder Survey** (Step 4 of the 9-step task loop):",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593N8014",
    "type": "heading",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NG006",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NG007",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NG008",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NG009",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00A",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00B"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG006",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG006:props:StringProp:00CS159860001",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG006:props:StringProp:00CS159860002",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00CS1593NG006",
    "text": "Inspect the source files and functions indicated by the Grapher survey.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG005",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG007",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593NG007",
    "text": "Map the execution flow and test coverage.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG005",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG008",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593NG008",
    "text": "Identify where the existing code matches or diverges from the graph's design.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG005",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG009",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593NG009",
    "text": "**DO NOT modify source code during this turn.**",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG005",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00A",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593NG00A",
    "text": "The Grapher will file your survey before code changes begin, ensuring the implementation starts from a recorded baseline.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG005",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00B",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593NG00B",
    "text": "---",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG005",
    "type": "thematicBreak",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00C",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "#### 3. Ask Back When Unsure (Never Guess)",
    "text": "Stop and formulate a `**Question**` in your Report rather than making assumptions if:",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593N8014",
    "type": "heading",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00D",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00E",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00F",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00G",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00H",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00J",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00K",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00M",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00N"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00D",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00D:props:StringProp:00CS159868000",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00D:props:StringProp:00CS159868001",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00CS1593NG00D",
    "text": "The Ask is ambiguous and plausible interpretations lead to different implementations.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00C",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00E",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593NG00E",
    "text": "The change requires unanticipated public API or schema adjustments.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00C",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00F",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593NG00F",
    "text": "The existing code contradicts the Grapher survey or the cited design doc.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00C",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00G",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593NG00G",
    "text": "There are multiple viable approaches requiring an architectural trade-off.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00C",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00H",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593NG00H",
    "text": "The scope of required changes significantly exceeds what the Ask indicated.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00C",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00J",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Report Format for Questions**",
    "text": "**Report Format for Questions**:",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00C",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00K",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593NG00K",
    "text": "```markdown\n- **Report**: <Summary of progress so far>\n  - **Question**: <What you found, why it blocks, and the options considered>\n```",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00C",
    "type": "code",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00M",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593NG00M",
    "text": "End the turn with completed subturns recorded and staged. Never proceed with a speculative choice \"to save a turn.\"",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00C",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00N",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593NG00N",
    "text": "---",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00C",
    "type": "thematicBreak",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00P",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "#### 4. Checking the Graph Before Formulating Code Theories",
    "text": "Before forming hypotheses about existing behavior, check the graph's established record:",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593N8014",
    "type": "heading",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00Q",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00R",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00S"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00Q",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593NG00Q",
    "text": "```bash\n# 1. Grep the raw store for the relevant filename or symbol:\ngrep -n -C3 '<filename.ts>' AperasKG/Apeiron/BlockNode.jsonld\n\n# 2. Unfold matching nodes:\naperas unfold <id>\n\n# 3. Follow forward links up to the governing design tier:\naperas unfold <design-block-id>\n```",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00P",
    "type": "code",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00R",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593NG00R",
    "text": "Always compare what the code actually does against what `design/` specifies. That discrepancy is the primary indicator of drift.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00P",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00S",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593NG00S",
    "text": "---",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00P",
    "type": "thematicBreak",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00T",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "#### 5. Operational Invariants (What Stays Out of Your Hands)",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593N8014",
    "type": "heading",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00V",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00W",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00X"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00V",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00V:props:StringProp:00CS15986R000",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00V:props:StringProp:00CS15986R001",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "**Write only in your thread**",
    "text": "**Write only in your thread**: Never write directly to discussion, issues, design, or another agent's thread. Report findings in `.threads/coder.md` for the Grapher to file.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00T",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00W",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Never touch `artifacts/**.md` files directly**",
    "text": "**Never touch `artifacts/**.md` files directly**: Never use `view_file` or edit markdown projections on disk.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00T",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00X",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Never omit subturns**",
    "text": "**Never omit subturns**: Results and tool friction not captured in subturns are permanently lost to subsequent turns.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00T",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00Y",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "### aperas-grapher/SKILL.md",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593MG001",
    "type": "heading",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00Z",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NG010",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NG011",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NG012",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NG013",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NG014",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NG015",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NG01W",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NR007",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NR00W",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NR015",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NR01B"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00Z",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593NG00Z",
    "text": "```\n---\nname: aperas-grapher\ndescription: >-\n  The grapher role in Aperas multi-agent work: the only role that writes the graph at large —\n  deep read, deep write, every promotion, thread lifecycle. Preloaded by the aperas-grapher\n  subagent; load it only when acting as grapher. Requires the base `aperas` skill.\n---\n```",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00Y",
    "type": "code",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG010",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "Status",
    "text": "Status: **v4** — Grapher role skill.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00Y",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG011",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593NG011",
    "text": "You are the **Grapher**. You manage and modify the Apeiron knowledge graph.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00Y",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG012",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593NG012",
    "text": "The base `aperas` skill applies in full. You perform deep reads, deep writes, promotions, and thread lifecycle management. You write everything in the graph except the Orchestrator's Freeflow/Asks and the Coder's thread nodes.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00Y",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG013",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593NG013",
    "text": "> **Aperas-repo insiders**: Run CLI commands from `Aperas/monorepo/` as `npm run aperas -- <verb> ...`. In normal projects using the published package, run bare `aperas <verb> ...`.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00Y",
    "type": "blockquote",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG014",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593NG014",
    "text": "---",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00Y",
    "type": "thematicBreak",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG015",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "#### 1. Every Invocation (Turn Protocol)",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00Y",
