      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NR011:props:StringProp:00CS15989G001",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "**Move nodes cleanly**",
    "text": "**Move nodes cleanly**: Use `aperas insert <node-id> --after <anchor-id> --flush` with **no stdin**.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NR010",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NR012",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Retype in place**",
    "text": "**Retype in place**: Use `aperas retype <ref> --to <type>` to change node kinds without losing identity, backlinks, or history.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NR010",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NR013",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Heading updates**",
    "text": "**Heading updates**: Always pass `--text-only` when retitling headings to protect child nodes.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NR010",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NR014",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593NR014",
    "text": "---",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NR00W",
    "type": "thematicBreak",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NR015",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "#### 5. Provenance at the Origin",
    "text": "Citation direction allows links to point **UP** or **SIDEWAYS**, never **DOWN**:",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NG00Y",
    "type": "heading",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NR016",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NR017",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NR019",
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NR01A"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NR016",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NR016:props:StringProp:00CS15989G002",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NR016:props:StringProp:00CS15989R000",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00CS1593NR016",
    "text": "When promoting a finding from `discussion/` into `issues/` or `design/`, the formal doc cannot link down to the discussion node.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NR015",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NR017",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Solution**",
    "text": "**Solution**: Add the link at the **origin** (the discussion node):",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NR015",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CS1593NR018"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NR018",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593NR018",
    "text": "```markdown\n  - Promoted to [Title](../issues/concern.md#id/BlockNode:00XXXXXXXX000)\n  ```",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NR017",
    "type": "code",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CS1593NR019",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CS1593NR019",
    "text": "Provenance surfaces automatically on the formal doc as a backlink (`aperas backlinks <id> --text`).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CS1593NR015",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
