    "title": "**Tool gap — Antigravity subagent harness lacks bash/terminal CLI execution tools**",
    "text": "**Tool gap — Antigravity subagent harness lacks bash/terminal CLI execution tools**: Antigravity subagents are invoked with read/search tools (`view_file`, `send_message`, etc.) but lack `run_command` or bash execution. As a result, Grapher subagents cannot directly execute `npm run aperas` CLI commands (e.g. `insert`, `zoom`, `check-links`) or `git add` from within the subagent environment, requiring the Orchestrator to execute graph mutations on their behalf. Recorded as a subagent harness configuration issue for multi-agent host setup. Promoted to [Antigravity subagent harness lacks terminal execution and file-write capabilities by default](../issues/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CTVZR8P0001).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CE8XWZK0001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
