    "title": "**Native harness artifacts are for human communication only**",
    "text": "**Native harness artifacts are for human communication only**: Harness-native artifacts (e.g. Antigravity artifacts) exist solely for presenting proposals, alternatives, or visual designs to the human user. They are never a substrate for task planning, execution tracking, or agent coordination; all task state, implementation tracking, and working memory live exclusively in Apeiron and thread files.",
