    "title": "Native harness artifacts (e.g. Antigravity artifacts)",
    "text": "Native harness artifacts (e.g. Antigravity artifacts): Restricted solely to communicating proposals, discussion summaries, or visual alignment to the human user. Never use native harness artifacts for implementation tracking, execution task lists, or subagent dispatch — all task state lives in `.threads/` and Apeiron.",
