    "title": "**v4.1 — operational gating refinements: dual memory/rules, positive behavioral bridge, native artifact scope, and meta-task ownership**",
    "text": "**v4.1 — operational gating refinements: dual memory/rules, positive behavioral bridge, native artifact scope, and meta-task ownership**: recorded as [the v4.1 delta](../discussion/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CTTFFW08001). Resolved chronic gating failures by replacing passive negative prohibitions with an imperative View Triage entry bridge, establishing dual memory/rules (`.agents/rules/aperas.md`), restricting native harness artifacts strictly to user communication, and assigning codebase-tracked meta-tasks exclusively to the Coder role.",
