        "predicate": "[[wikilink]]",
        "props": [
          {
            "@id": "BlockNode:00CTVZR8P0001:links:Link:00CTVZREW0000:props:StringProp:00CTVZREW8000",
            "@type": "StringProp",
            "key": "position",
            "value": "350"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "title": "**Antigravity subagent harness lacks terminal execution and file-write capabilities by default**",
    "text": "**Antigravity subagent harness lacks terminal execution and file-write capabilities by default**: By default, Antigravity provisions subagents with read-only inspection tools. Grapher subagents cannot execute `npm run aperas` CLI commands to insert or project nodes, and Coder subagents cannot apply code diffs or run verification tests. Provenance: [BlockNode:00CTTBGC00002](../discussion/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CTTBGC00002). **Resolved**: subagent runtime registration (`define_subagent` with `enable_write_tools: true`) enables write and terminal tools in active session; persistent frontmatter configuration declared in `.agents/agents/aperas-coder.md` and `.agents/agents/aperas-grapher.md`. Verified by `aperas-coder`.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CEA5KW4G00A",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
