    "text": "**Subagent execution bottlenecks — Grapher Opening Phase and Tool & CLI Phase investigation (2026-10-01)**: Detailed trajectory analysis of subagent latencies in Turn 1 (Grapher ~8m, Coder ~9.5m), identifying root causes across the opening initialization and CLI execution phases.",
