    "title": "**Grapher Opening Phase bottlenecks (~3m 10s, steps 1–56)**",
    "text": "**Grapher Opening Phase bottlenecks (~3m 10s, steps 1–56)**:",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CTX70TPR001",
