    ],
    "title": "**ApeironNgn service crash and restart recovery (~1m 15s, steps 19–32)**",
    "text": "**ApeironNgn service crash and restart recovery (~1m 15s, steps 19–32)**: At Step 19, `npm run aperas -- unfold BlockNode:00CN7G6D0G001` abruptly failed with `[aperas] Failed: No ApeironNgn service running`. Grapher spent over a minute in an iterative recovery loop: `service status` (failed: only start/stop/restart exist), `service start` (reported already running with PID 33824), `service restart` (killed PID 33824, then timed out waiting for Apeiron store rehydration), `ps aux | grep aperas` (polling process rehydration), and finally `service start` until PID 35558 answered.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CTX70TPR002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CTX70TPR004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Redundant skill self-reading (steps 3–5)**",
    "text": "**Redundant skill self-reading (steps 3–5)**: Despite `aperas` and `aperas-grapher` skills being preloaded in its system prompt, Grapher immediately called `view_file` on both `skills/aperas-grapher/SKILL.md` and `skills/aperas/SKILL.md`, burning two full turn round-trips before reading the incoming Ask.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CTX70TPR002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CTX70TQ0000",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Exploratory JSON-LD grep scans for promotion syntax (steps 43–55)**",
    "text": "**Exploratory JSON-LD grep scans for promotion syntax (steps 43–55)**: Lacking explicit formatting templates in the skill instructions, Grapher ran multiple greps over raw `AperasKG/Apeiron/BlockNode.jsonld` (`grep \"Promoted to\"`, `grep \"Origin:\"`, `grep \"provenance\"`) to deduce how past issue titles and provenance text were constructed.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CTX70TPR002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CTX70TQ0001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Tool & CLI Phase bottlenecks (remaining 4–5.5 minutes across both subagents)**",
    "text": "**Tool & CLI Phase bottlenecks (remaining 4–5.5 minutes across both subagents)**:",
