        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "**Root causes for existing skill mechanics failure (v4 TOC removal, slice truncation, and reference gaps)**",
    "text": "**Root causes for existing skill mechanics failure (v4 TOC removal, slice truncation, and reference gaps)**: Detailed analysis of why `SKILL.md` Section 4 failed to guide the subagents during Turn 1:",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CTX70TPR001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CTY63E98002",
      "BlockNode:00CTY63E9G000",
      "BlockNode:00CTY63E9G001"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CTY63E98002",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CTY63E98002:props:StringProp:00CTY63M40000",
