    "title": "### aperas — Discipline — Task Loop Step 1 Recipes and Graph Pathing",
    "text": "Supersedes: [v4 Open Task](#id/BlockNode:00CS1593MR015) [v4 Thread initialization](#id/BlockNode:00CS1593N002W) [v4 Orchestrator Verification](#id/BlockNode:00CS1593MR01B) [v4 Git-ignored threads](#id/BlockNode:00CS1593MR01E)",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CTTFFW08001",
