    "title": "**Resolution Rule**",
    "text": "**Resolution Rule**:\nPaths passed to the `aperas` CLI always resolve relative to the graph's `artifacts` root defined in `aperas.config.json` (i.e. `AperasKG/artifacts/`), **never** against the filesystem `$CWD` or code repository root.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7000G",
