      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800X:props:StringProp:00CV2CG2H0001",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "**For Code/Engine changes**",
    "text": "**For Code/Engine changes**: Execute the repo test command (`npm run verify` from `monorepo/`).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800W",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800Y",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**For Skill-only changes**",
    "text": "**For Skill-only changes**: Strictly **DO NOT** run `npm run verify`. Instead, run:",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800W",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800Z",
      "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78010"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800Z",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CV2CFX7800Z",
    "text": "```bash\n    python3 skills/aperas/scripts/skill_drift.py\n    npm run aperas -- check-links\n    ```",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800Y",
    "type": "code",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78010",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CV2CFX78010",
    "text": "Running `npm run verify` on skill modifications is a severe process violation that leads to test timeouts and compute waste.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800Y",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
  },
  {
