    "title": "### aperas-coder — 6-Step Turn Execution Template and Mechanics Reference",
    "text": "Supersedes: [v4 Coder step 1 view tree](#id/BlockNode:00CS1593N801E) [v4 Coder step 1 dispatch msg](#id/BlockNode:00CS1593N801F) [v4 Coder step 2 thread context](#id/BlockNode:00CS1593N801H) [v4 Coder step 2 review earlier turns](#id/BlockNode:00CS1593N801J) [v4 Coder step 2 working memory](#id/BlockNode:00CS1593N801K) [v4 Coder step 3 subturns](#id/BlockNode:00CS1593N801M) [v4 Coder step 3 tool batch](#id/BlockNode:00CS1593N801N) [v4 Coder step 3 files inspected](#id/BlockNode:00CS1593N801P) [v4 Coder step 3 exact test outputs](#id/BlockNode:00CS1593N801Q) [v4 Coder step 3 decisions](#id/BlockNode:00CS1593N801R) [v4 Coder step 4 report](#id/BlockNode:00CS1593N801S) [v4 Coder step 4 report node](#id/BlockNode:00CS1593N801T) [v4 Coder step 4 cite graph nodes](#id/BlockNode:00CS1593N801V) [v4 Coder step 4 question tool gap](#id/BlockNode:00CS1593N801W) [v4 Coder step 4 reroot view](#id/BlockNode:00CS1593N801X) [v4 Coder step 4 zoom command](#id/BlockNode:00CS1593N801Y) [v4 Coder step 4 chat response](#id/BlockNode:00CS1593NG000) [v4 Coder step 5 stage code](#id/BlockNode:00CS1593NG001) [v4 Coder step 5 git add](#id/BlockNode:00CS1593NG002) [v4 Coder step 4 rule](#id/BlockNode:00CS1593NG003)",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CTTFFW08001",
    "type": "heading",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78013",
      "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7801X",
      "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7801Y"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78013",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "Every coder turn follows this strict 6-step lifecycle",
    "text": "Every coder turn follows this strict 6-step lifecycle:",
