    "title": "Pipe both `- **Work**` and `- **Report**` in a single `insert` command positioned `--after <ask-id>`",
    "text": "Pipe both `- **Work**` and `- **Report**` in a single `insert` command positioned `--after <ask-id>`:",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78029",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7802B"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7802B",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CV2CFX7802B",
    "text": "```bash\n     cat << 'EOF' | npm run aperas -- insert <turn-id> --after <ask-id> --flush\n     - **Work**: <approach in a sentence>\n       - Subturn 1 (<focus>): <exact details, nodes unfolded/modified, traversal checks, results>\n       - Subturn 2 (<focus>): <details>\n     - **Report**: <outcome in a sentence>\n       - [<node or doc ref>](...) — <what changed, or what it shows>\n       - **Question**: <whatever the Ask left unsettled or unexpected graph state>\n       - **Tool gap — <what>**: <workaround built, call that failed or hung>\n     EOF\n     ```",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7802A",
    "type": "code",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX7802C",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "*Note*",
    "text": "*Note*: Writing Work and Report in a single piped AST insertion guarantees atomic recording and avoids orphan nodes.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2CFX78029",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
