  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2ZRHWR001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Skill size audit — Claude Code 5,000-token compaction threshold and progressive disclosure refactor (2026-10-01)**",
    "text": "**Skill size audit — Claude Code 5,000-token compaction threshold and progressive disclosure refactor (2026-10-01)**: Detailed analysis of base skill growth (497 lines, 30.6 KB, ~5,800 tokens) against harness thresholds, identifying compaction truncation in Claude Code and defining the progressive disclosure refactoring architecture:",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CE8XWZK0001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CV2ZRHWR002",
      "BlockNode:00CV2ZRHWR003",
      "BlockNode:00CV2ZRHWR004",
      "BlockNode:00CV2ZRHWR005"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2ZRHWR002",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2ZRHWR002:props:StringProp:00CV2ZRR98000",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2ZRHWR002:props:StringProp:00CV2ZRR98001",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "**Current file metrics**",
    "text": "**Current file metrics**: `skills/aperas/SKILL.md` has expanded to 497 lines and 30,572 bytes (~5,500–6,000 tokens), sitting at 99.4% of the 500-line recommended ceiling and exceeding the 5,000-token budget.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2ZRHWR001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2ZRHWR003",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Compaction truncation risk in Claude Code**",
    "text": "**Compaction truncation risk in Claude Code**: In Claude Code, skills are loaded into context upon trigger. When conversation context approaches limits, Claude Code executes context compaction. Skills that exceed the 5,000-token threshold are subject to aggressive truncation and summarization during compaction. This drops detailed CLI syntax rules, anchor constraints, and operational gates mid-session, causing subagents to make blind edits or read engine source code.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2ZRHWR001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2ZRHWR004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Antigravity tool bounds vs. self-truncation**",
    "text": "**Antigravity tool bounds vs. self-truncation**: Antigravity's `view_file` tool supports up to 800 lines and 46 KB, so `SKILL.md` fits in a single view call. However, subagents self-truncate reads (e.g. requesting lines 1–100 or 1–250). While the restored Table of Contents mitigates initial discovery, long files remain vulnerable to incomplete context loading.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2ZRHWR001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2ZRHWR005",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Refactoring architecture (Progressive Disclosure)**",
    "text": "**Refactoring architecture (Progressive Disclosure)**:",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2ZRHWR001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CV2ZRHWR006",
      "BlockNode:00CV2ZRHX0000",
      "BlockNode:00CV2ZRHX0001"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2ZRHWR006",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2ZRHWR006:props:StringProp:00CV2ZRR9G000",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2ZRHWR006:props:StringProp:00CV2ZRR9G001",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00CV2ZRHWR006",
    "text": "Retain Section 1 Philosophy, Section 2 Orientation, Section 3 Discipline (roles, 9-step task loop, thread rules), and a concise command cheatsheet in a lean core `SKILL.md` (~250–300 lines, ~3,000 tokens).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2ZRHWR005",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2ZRHX0000",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CV2ZRHX0000",
    "text": "Move Section 4's deep CLI syntax, AST piping rules, anchor placement, list item update subtleties, and troubleshooting into an on-demand reference document: `skills/aperas/references/mechanics.md`.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2ZRHWR005",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV2ZRHX0001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CV2ZRHX0001",
    "text": "Subagents load the lean core skill by default, and only consult `references/mechanics.md` when executing non-trivial graph mutations.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV2ZRHWR005",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
