    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV3K19P0003",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CV3K19P0003",
    "text": "High-level cheatsheet for daily CLI use. For the exhaustive reference manual — AST tree parsing, `--after` anchor placement constraints, list mutation subtleties, heading child preservation, block retyping, artifact renames, shell quoting, service recovery, and link sweeps — consult [`references/mechanics.md`](references/mechanics.md).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV3K19P0002",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV3K19P0004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CV3K19P0004",
    "text": "| Operation | Command Pattern | Key Rule / Note |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Peek / View** | `aperas unfold <ref> [--view <n>]` / `tree` | Peek node or render structured view lens |\n| **Inspect State** | `aperas show <ref> [--text]` / `backlinks` | Exact stored text, full record, or dependents |\n| **Insert Turn** | `cat turn.md \\| aperas insert <id> --after <a>`| Pipes markdown AST subtree after anchor child |\n| **Zoom View** | `aperas zoom <id> --view <name> --flush` | Re-roots view onto current Ask or Report |\n| **Update Node** | `echo \"text\" \\| aperas update <id> [--text-only]`| `--text-only` preserves kids; bare tombstones |\n| **Insert / Reposition**| `aperas insert <par> [--after <sib>]` | Bullet `- ` inserts; no stdin moves node |\n| **Sweep / Service** | `aperas check-links` / `service restart` | Sweeps internal links; restarts daemon |",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV3K19P0002",
    "type": "table",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV3K19P0005",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CV3K19P0005",
    "text": "```bash\naperas unfold <ref> [--view <name>]                          # Peek node or unfold into view\naperas tree --view <name>                                    # Render structured lens of view\ncat turn.md | aperas insert <turn-id> --after <ask> --flush  # Insert Work + Report tree\naperas zoom <id> --view <name> --flush                       # Re-root view onto Ask/Report\necho \"text\" | aperas update <id> --text-only --flush         # Update node (preserves kids)\necho \"- text\" | aperas insert <par> --after <sib> --flush    # Insert list item (needs bullet)\naperas check-links [--repair]                                # Sweep / repair link integrity\n```",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV3K19P0002",
    "type": "code",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV3K19P0006",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "props": [
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CV3K19P0006:props:StringProp:00CV3K1HB0000",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "orderedList",
        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CV3K19P0006:props:StringProp:00CV3K1HB8000",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "Two sibling repos",
    "text": "Two sibling repos: `Aperas/` (code/skills; symlink `Aperas/AperasKG -> ../AperasKG`) and `AperasKG/` (graph `Apeiron/`, markdown `artifacts/`).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV3K19P0002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV3K19P0007",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "Resolution Rule",
    "text": "Resolution Rule: CLI paths resolve relative to `artifacts/` in `AperasKG/`, never against `$CWD` or code root (`npm run aperas -- project discussion/foo.md` is correct; resolving `.threads/` against `$CWD` fails).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV3K19P0002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV3K19P0008",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Code/Engine changes**",
    "text": "**Code/Engine changes**: Run `npm run verify` (from `monorepo/`) to execute build, lint, and tests.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV3K19P0002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV3K19P0009",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**Skill-only changes**",
    "text": "**Skill-only changes**: Strictly **NEVER** run `npm run verify`! Running full test suites on skill edits causes unnecessary hangs, compute waste, and test timeouts. Verify using: `python3 skills/aperas/scripts/skill_drift.py && npm run aperas -- check-links`.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV3K19P0002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CV3K19P000A",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CV3K19P000A",
    "text": "---",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CV3K19P0002",
    "type": "thematicBreak",
    "children": []
  },
