    "title": "**Decision — scope of the skill edit**",
    "text": "**Decision — scope of the skill edit**: (user, answers to three direct questions) The edit covers the four `SKILL.md` bodies and callouts, the `aperas_gate.py` deny message trimmed to `aperas`, and `skills/kg-doc-ingest/SKILL.md` line 16 with its pointer to the removed callout dropped. `skills/aperas-workspace/graph-sandbox.sh` is left alone, since it runs the dev source on purpose and is not a skill. `npm run verify` stays, because it is a real repo script.",
