    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CVJXQWNR000",
    "text": "> [!IMPORTANT]\n> **`.threads/` is a graph path, not a local directory**:\n> `.threads/` is a graph node path rooted under `artifacts/.threads/` in `AperasKG/`. Projections under `artifacts/.threads/` are Git-ignored in `AperasKG`.\n> There is no `.threads/` directory in the `Aperas/` code repository. Never run `ls .threads/` or `cat .threads/...`. Access threads strictly through graph commands (`aperas tree .threads/grapher.md`, `aperas show .threads/grapher.md`).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CVJXQWNG006",
    "type": "blockquote",
    "children": []
