    "title": "Pipe both `- **Work**` and `- **Report**` in a single `insert` command positioned `--after <ask-id>`",
    "text": "Pipe both `- **Work**` and `- **Report**` in a single `insert` command positioned `--after <ask-id>`:",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CVJXQWNR007",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CVJXQWNR009"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CVJXQWNR009",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CVJXQWNR009",
    "text": "```bash\n  cat << 'EOF' | aperas insert <turn-id> --after <ask-id> --flush\n  - **Work**: <approach in a sentence>\n    - Subturn 1 (<focus>): <exact details, files inspected/changed, commands run, failure lines, results>\n    - Subturn 2 (<focus>): <details>\n  - **Report**: <outcome in a sentence>\n    - [<node or file ref>](...) — <what changed, or what it shows>\n    - **Question — <topic>**: <whatever the Ask left unsettled or unexpected code behaviors>\n    - **Friction — <topic>**: <a mistake of your own, a tool-use problem, or a tool gap: workaround built, call that failed or hung>\n  EOF\n  ```",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CVJXQWNR008",
    "type": "code",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CVJXQWNR00A",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CVJXQWNR00A",
    "text": "Re-root your output view onto the newly inserted Report node ID:",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CVJXQWNR007",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CVJXQWNR00B"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CVJXQWNR00B",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CVJXQWNR00B",
    "text": "```bash\n  aperas zoom <report-id> --view <p>-coder-orchestrator --flush\n  ```",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CVJXQWNR00A",
    "type": "code",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CVJXQWNR00C",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CVJXQWNR00C",
    "text": "Project the updated thread back to the disk mirror (pipe `echo yes` to handle any overwrite prompts):",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CVJXQWNR007",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CVJXQWNR00D"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CVJXQWNR00D",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CVJXQWNR00D",
    "text": "```bash\n  echo yes | aperas project .threads/coder.md --flush\n  ```",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CVJXQWNR00C",
    "type": "code",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CVJXQWNR00E",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
