    "title": "**Open — investigate as its own task**",
    "text": "**Open — investigate as its own task**: Reproduce with the lock, socket and token files and a concurrent second client, and have the service log client connect failures. Not started.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CVK45ZQ0001",
    "type": "listItem",
