    "text": "Promoted to [issues/linking.md Open Issues](../issues/linking.md#id/BlockNode:00CVKFWNB8001) — the repro the Finding asked for was confirmed (a throwaway id link to a nonexistent node was reported \"1 resolved, 0 dangling\" by the insert and \"0 discrepancies\" by check-links) and the root cause traced to the `aperas://id/` branch of `resolveDeepPathDetail`.",
