  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CVM2MEX800A",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CVM2MEX800A",
    "text": "| Role | Runs As | Writes | Reads |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **Orchestrator** | Active session | `discussion` Freeflow, thread `**Ask**` nodes | Graph, threads, **and source code/diffs/tests to check, assess or review a result or claim** |\n| **Grapher** | Subagent | Everything else in graph (deep read/write, promotions, thread lifecycle) | Graph, thread reports |\n| **Coder** | Subagent | Source code, `.threads/coder.md` | Source code, graph context |",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CVM2MEX8009",
    "type": "table",
    "children": []
  },
