    "title": "### aperas-coder — Ask Back When Unsure, Question lead-in carries a topic",
    "text": "Supersedes: [v4 Stop and formulate a Question](#id/BlockNode:00CS1593NG00C) [v4 Report Format for Questions](#id/BlockNode:00CS1593NG00K)",
