  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CVM2Q9Z8002",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CVM2Q9Z8002",
    "text": "Stop and formulate a `**Question — <topic>**` in your Report rather than making assumptions if:",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CVM2Q9Z8001",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CVM2Q9Z8003",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CVM2Q9Z8003",
    "text": "```markdown\n- **Report**: <Summary of progress so far>\n  - **Question — <topic>**: <What you found, why it blocks, and the options considered>\n```",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CVM2Q9Z8001",
    "type": "code",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CVM2Q9Z8004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CVM2Q9Z8004",
    "text": "End the turn with completed subturns recorded and staged. Never proceed with a speculative choice \"to save a turn.\"",
