    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CVM2Q9Z8009",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "### aperas-grapher — Skill Drift Verification, Status entries and the guard",
    "text": "A delta titled vN needs one `Status` entry per skill whose `Status:` line moved, `skill_drift.py` fails when the newest delta's version differs from the `Status:` lines, and a mismatch is a Question to the orchestrator.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CVJXQWNG001",
    "type": "heading",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CVM39ANG001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CVM39ANG001",
    "text": "A skill's `Status:` line carries the version of the newest recorded delta, or of the snapshot when there is none. A delta titled vN therefore needs one `Status` entry per skill whose line moved to vN, each superseding that skill's previous `Status` unit, and the versions compare with trailing zeros trimmed, so v4 equals v4.0. A line ahead of the record is a finding as much as one behind it, and a mismatch is raised to the orchestrator as a question rather than resolved by guessing which side is right.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CF595QQR001",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
  },
  {
