    "title": "**Filed — four tool gaps from this task, each promoted to its tool issue**",
    "text": "**Filed — four tool gaps from this task, each promoted to its tool issue**: the unhandled `EPIPE` on a closed output pipe (the coder's friction, reproduced here on `aperas tree` and `aperas unfold`), the `aperas.ts` skill-count mismatch, the spurious \"No ApeironNgn service running\" while the service is up, and `skill_drift.py` cutting units with no `--full` flag. Promoted to [the `EPIPE` issue](../issues/cli.md#id/BlockNode:00CVMP9N58001), [the skill-count issue](../issues/cli.md#id/BlockNode:00CVMP9N5G000), [the service-ping issue](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00CVMPABY8001) and [the drift-truncation issue](../issues/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CVMPB2Y0001).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CVKQDJ2G001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
