    "text": "**Already filed earlier**: [the `aperas --help` skill-count mismatch](../issues/cli.md#id/BlockNode:00CVMP9N5G000), [the closed-pipe `EPIPE`](../issues/cli.md#id/BlockNode:00CVMP9N58001), [the `skill_drift.py` truncation](../issues/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CVMPB2Y0001) and [the `check-links` miss on a nonexistent id](../issues/linking.md#id/BlockNode:00CVKFWNB8001).",
