    "title": "**Resolved — History's Current Status points at the v4 milestones**",
    "text": "**Resolved — History's Current Status points at the v4 milestones**: [Current Status](../history/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CEA5MHD8002) gained one sentence linking the [v4](../history/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CTTFT4HR001), [v4.1](../history/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CTTFT4HR002), [v4.2](../history/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CVMPRD60001) and [v4.3](../history/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CVMPRD60002) milestones, as [Decision — History's Current Status gains a sentence pointing at the v4 milestones](#id/BlockNode:00CVMS4YMR003) asked.",
