          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "title": "**Decision — record the link-sweep lead on the removal-stall issue**",
    "text": "**Decision — record the link-sweep lead on the removal-stall issue**: (user: \"worth recording to the workflow\") The grapher adds the whole-artifact link-integrity sweeps before and after each `remove`, `insert`, `update` and `retype` to the stall issue [removal stall](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00CVNX6A3R000) as a suspected cause, labelled untested, with the link to the earlier verify-slowdown issue. It joins the next grapher Filing turn.",
