    "title": "### aperas-orchestrator — Why Stateless Dispatch is Mandatory, Preventing Transcript Bloat",
    "text": "Supersedes: [v4.1 Preventing Transcript Bloat](#id/BlockNode:00CV2CFX7800S)",
